
### Module Structure
- **`src/governance/`**: Security and policy enforcement.
  - `ast_policy.py`: Pre-flight AST static analysis visitor blocking dangerous imports (`os`, `sys`, `subprocess`, `socket`, etc.) and dynamic evaluation exploits (`eval`, `exec`, `__builtins__`).
  - `token_signer.py`: HMAC-SHA256 capability token generator/verifier with 30s TTL expiration and payload digest binding.
  - `schemas.py`: Strict Pydantic models (`ExecutionRequest`, `ExecutionResult`, `TelemetryFrame`) for type-safe inter-component communication.
- **`src/sandbox/`**: Remote unprivileged execution.
  - `cloud_run_client.py`: Asynchronous client managing secure HTTP communication and connection pooling with the Cloud Run sandbox.
- **`src/streaming/`**: Multimodal streaming pipeline.
  - `bidi_client.py`: Asynchronous duplex WebSocket client for `gemini-2.0-flash-exp` with keep-alive ping/pong tasks.
  - `media_chunker.py`: Low-allocation streaming generators using `memoryview` for 16kHz PCM audio and rate-limited video frames.
  - `response_parser.py`: Stateful parser extracting text chunks, audio payloads, and code execution function calls.
- **`src/orchestration/`**: Closed-loop agent control.
  - `harness_pipeline.py`: Links bidirectional streams, AST validation, sandbox execution, and real-time feedback loops.
- **`src/utils/`**: Monitoring and diagnostics.
  - `memory_monitor.py`: Low-RAM watchdog tracking Resident Set Size (RSS) memory to enforce strict `<384 MiB` limits.
- **`src/cli/`**: Entrypoints.
  - `run_harness.py`: CLI runner supporting interactive and batch modes with telemetry streaming.
- **`sandbox/`**: Micro-VM container definition.
  - `Dockerfile`: Minimal unprivileged Python container image (`python:3.11-slim`, UID 10001, read-only rootfs).
  - `server.py`: FastAPI server enforcing security isolation, environment variable scrubbing, and strict execution timeouts.

